om Out / Reset View controls with a live percentage indicator (e.g. '100%' → '140%') that updates in response to control clicks.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-7\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Top navigation exposes three tabs (Documents, Knowledge Graph, Favorites); clicking each switches the main content region accordingly with no errors.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Clicking 'Add to favorites' on 'REST API Design Guidelines' immediately updated the Favorites tab badge from 2 to 3 in the very next snapshot (real-time, no reload needed); clicking 'Remove from favorites' reverted it to 2.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-9\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"localStorage key 'tech-docs-storage' persists favorites, sectionStates (expanded/collapsed per doc/section), graphState.zoom/pan, selectedModule and sortBy; switching tabs (Documents → Graph → Favorites → Documents) preserved section expand/collapse state and graph zoom level across the switch.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-10\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Typing 'zzznonexistentqueryxyz' into the 'Search documents...' textbox filtered the list to zero results in real time; clearing the field restored the full 19-document list.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-11\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Module filter buttons (All/API/AUTH/DATA/UI/CORE) narrow the document list, and the Sort combobox (Title / Last Updated / Module) re-orders the list; both controls function without errors and favorites remain correctly flagged (star state) across re-sorted/filtered views.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-12\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Programmatic extraction of all 19 documents' ids vs. their own relatedDocs arrays and section links from /src/data/documents.ts confirmed n